for i,l in enumerate(lines):
 s=ansi.sub('',l)
 m=re.search(r'Epoch (\d+)/(\d+) Step (\d+)/(\d+) Train step (\d+)/(\d+) done',s)
 if m: cur={'epoch':int(m.group(1)),'step':int(m.group(5)),'line':i+1}
 if cur and '│' in s and not ('╒' in s or '╞' in s or '╘' in s):
  cells=[x.strip() for x in s.split('│')[1:-1]]
  # cells alternating key value; values scientific
  if len(cells)>=2:
   for j in range(0,len(cells)-1,2):
    k,v=cells[j],cells[j+1]
    try: x=float(v)
    except: continue
    if k: cur.setdefault('m',{})[k]=x
 if cur and '╘' in s:
  metrics.append(cur); cur=None
print('tables',len(metrics))
keys=sorted(set(k for d in metrics for k in d.get('m',{})))
print('keys',len(keys)); print('\n'.join(keys))
for k in ['rollout/reward','ppo_actor/task_reward/avg','ppo_actor/correct_n_seqs','ppo_actor/incorrect_n_seqs','ppo_actor/seq_len/avg','ppo_actor/no_eos_ratios/avg','ppo_actor/update/rs_filtered_fraction','ppo_actor/update/masked_token_ratio','ppo_actor/update/n_valid_tokens_in_loss','ppo_actor/update/actor_loss/avg','ppo_actor/update/approx_kl/avg','ppo_actor/update/behave_approx_kl/avg','ppo_actor/update/importance_weight/avg','ppo_actor/update/entropy/avg','ppo_actor/update/grad_norm','timeperf/rollout','timeperf/train_step','timeperf/eval']:
